   "text": "Curtin College - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nCurtin College\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nCurtin College is a pathway to Curtin University, Western Australia’s largest university. The College is on campus at Curtin University in Perth, so students will experience university life from day one. Curtin University is ranked in the top one per cent of universities worldwide in the Academic Ranking of World Universities 2018 and have risen 20 places to 230th in the world in the QS World University Ranking 2020.CRICOS Provider Code: 02042G.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 05:51\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n30/03/2026 09:01\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nAustralia\nYearly Fees\nMax: A$33,154.00\nMin: A$28,119.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n22%\n13,000 of 58,607 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n1966\nCampus(es)\nPerth\nCountry\nAustralia\nExcluded Countries\nAustralia, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, United States\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-MdLIlwSR8Q\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
